  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">해캄 내부 엽록체? 상태가 나선형 일때도 있고, 전체적으로 퍼져있을 때도 있고, 덩어리져 있을 때도 있는데요...<br>왜 그런건가요?<br>세포 분열 시 핵분열의 간기, 전기, 중기...에서<br>유전물질이 염색사 염색체로 변화하는것처럼<br>느껴지는데 그거와 비슷한건가요?<br><br>제 집 어항 수초 사이에 있던 물이끼인데<br>학교에서 중2  광합성 단원 가르치느라<br>가져와서 보니 해캄이었더군요...<br>생물 비전공자다보니  궁금해서 질문드려요~~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb1a6fd2a0334a6de448121bf6c56aae1d7067ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb1a6fd2a0334a6de448121bf6c56aae1d7067ec\" data-origin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0cb9f1f75e6012452fb41213e0fbe21a5cf16b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0cb9f1f75e6012452fb41213e0fbe21a5cf16b\" data-origin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"><div class=\"figcaption\">가운데는 나선형 모습,,,, 아래쪽에 덩어리진 모습...</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e88b7d6f6f73e6b5202eda0e19dfd68f57058ab9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e88b7d6f6f73e6b5202eda0e19dfd68f57058ab9\" data-origin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"><div class=\"figcaption\">전채적으로 흩어진 모습</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/905e8d38cfd20f38a4caeb1077b0a15c2d061b2f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/905e8d38cfd20f38a4caeb1077b0a15c2d061b2f\" data-origin-width=\"2268\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\